(3283807, 456291, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. This is a brilliant concept.  A FANTASTIC way to "think outside the box" while still respecting the challenge description.</td>', 'Oh wow. This is a brilliant concept.  A FANTASTIC way to "think outside the box" while still respecting the challenge description.', '2007-01-26 00:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283809, 457984, 62727, '<td valign="top">Stunning! 8</td>', 'Stunning! 8', '2007-01-26 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283811, 458293, 30861, '<td valign="top">A lovely image, very strong. I am sure you will be questioned re: the "subject fills the frame" aspect of the challenge. I agonized over that myself: I had landscapes I wanted to enter (the landscape IS the subject after all, and it does fill the frame) but decided to go in a completely different direction and not fight that battle. Good luck to you with this one :-)</td>', 'A lovely image, very strong. I am sure you will be questioned re: the "subject fills the frame" aspect of the challenge. I agonized over that myself: I had landscapes I wanted to enter (the landscape IS the subject after all, and it does fill the frame) but decided to go in a completely different direction and not fight that battle. Good luck to you with this one :-)', '2007-01-26 00:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283812, 457484, 67145, '<td valign="top">awesome .... excellent .. stunning ..... great photograph with amazing detail  ... love the crop, the colours the composition ... everything ..... =10</td>', 'awesome .... excellent .. stunning ..... great photograph with amazing detail  ... love the crop, the colours the composition ... everything ..... =10', '2007-01-26 00:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
