(3283831, 457537, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh man, that''s EXQUISITE in its own way. I absolutely LOVE the processing here, especially the precise hint of vignetting in all 4 corners. I''ll be very interested to see how this fares. keep me posted if you like, I am done with voting on this image :-)</td>', 'Oh man, that''s EXQUISITE in its own way. I absolutely LOVE the processing here, especially the precise hint of vignetting in all 4 corners. I''ll be very interested to see how this fares. keep me posted if you like, I am done with voting on this image :-)', '2007-01-26 00:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
