(3283884, 458816, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is very sweet in so many ways. The light is excellent, the colors are striking, the composition in general is crisp and clean. I wish you had more foreground lower left, to see more of the stoop (those stairs would be symbolically important to me), and I wish you''d used some shadow recovery on the dark entry on the left. But all-in-all, a strong image :-)</td>', 'This is very sweet in so many ways. The light is excellent, the colors are striking, the composition in general is crisp and clean. I wish you had more foreground lower left, to see more of the stoop (those stairs would be symbolically important to me), and I wish you''d used some shadow recovery on the dark entry on the left. But all-in-all, a strong image :-)', '2007-01-26 00:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
