(3283908, 457537, 15711, '<td valign="top">I find this very disturbing. The editing is superb but to me it looks like a dead baby.  I hope this doesn''t offend you but I showed it to 4 other people, and just said "what is your take on this" and they all said "dead baby."  I wanted  to make sure. It''s powerful.  7</td>', 'I find this very disturbing. The editing is superb but to me it looks like a dead baby.  I hope this doesn''t offend you but I showed it to 4 other people, and just said "what is your take on this" and they all said "dead baby."  I wanted  to make sure. It''s powerful.  7', '2007-01-26 00:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283909, 458749, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nicely Done.  I wish the color was a little more saturated.  I can''t tell if they are lemons or oranges.  They look like lemons.  Great setup and composition.  Maybe the lighting could be better.  Maybe a softer light?<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'Nicely Done.  I wish the color was a little more saturated.  I can''t tell if they are lemons or oranges.  They look like lemons.  Great setup and composition.  Maybe the lighting could be better.  Maybe a softer light? Great job.', '2007-01-26 00:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283910, 458816, 62727, '<td valign="top">I really like this! 10</td>', 'I really like this! 10', '2007-01-26 00:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283912, 455853, 51638, '<td valign="top">This will probably score well, but I''m afraid I''m one of those who''s not a fan of this much PP being done to skin. Especially not in kids, whose skin is so smooth as to not really require it IMO.</td>', 'This will probably score well, but I''m afraid I''m one of those who''s not a fan of this much PP being done to skin. Especially not in kids, whose skin is so smooth as to not really require it IMO.', '2007-01-26 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
