(3284428, 456286, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, very cool.  Reminds me of a study I read about where they showed people pictures they''d altered the same way you did this, with the mouths and eyes right-side up in an upside-down face.  Folks thought they looked normal.  Try it with a smiling face - it still looks pretty normal in the upside-down view, but right-side up it''s grotesque!</td>', 'Ah, very cool.  Reminds me of a study I read about where they showed people pictures they''d altered the same way you did this, with the mouths and eyes right-side up in an upside-down face.  Folks thought they looked normal.  Try it with a smiling face - it still looks pretty normal in the upside-down view, but right-side up it''s grotesque!', '2007-01-26 01:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
