(3288230, 458773, 70299, '<td valign="top">Very nice eyes...and you filled the frame appropriately.  But it lacks a professional look...if I can say that.  It just lacks the expertness that DPC seems to attract.  Look up how to do a diffusion on this picture, or a soft focus.  Plus, she has a lot of distracting hair and dark circles under her eyes.  I think the hand in the foreground is a quite a bit distracting as well!</td>', 'Very nice eyes...and you filled the frame appropriately.  But it lacks a professional look...if I can say that.  It just lacks the expertness that DPC seems to attract.  Look up how to do a diffusion on this picture, or a soft focus.  Plus, she has a lot of distracting hair and dark circles under her eyes.  I think the hand in the foreground is a quite a bit distracting as well!', '2007-01-26 17:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
