(3288485, 458814, 3320, '<td valign="top">Meet the challenge for me :-) However, Sharpening artifacts ( edges of the bec for exemple, and lack of details in the highlights. Good effort. 5. Lionel</td>', 'Meet the challenge for me :-) However, Sharpening artifacts ( edges of the bec for exemple, and lack of details in the highlights. Good effort. 5. Lionel', '2007-01-26 19:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3288502, 458709, 3320, '<td valign="top">Nice centered composition. Something really bothers me in the focus, or it is a bit blurred because the exposure was too slow or you did not use a tripod. I do not see any side effects of sharpening so maybe you could have sharpen a bit more in the processing ? Good effort. Lionel</td>', 'Nice centered composition. Something really bothers me in the focus, or it is a bit blurred because the exposure was too slow or you did not use a tripod. I do not see any side effects of sharpening so maybe you could have sharpen a bit more in the processing ? Good effort. Lionel', '2007-01-26 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3288518, 458759, 3320, '<td valign="top">It does not impact my note for your picture, but you should have edited that white pixel on the nose (in this challenge with the rule you could have). Lionel</td>', 'It does not impact my note for your picture, but you should have edited that white pixel on the nose (in this challenge with the rule you could have). Lionel', '2007-01-26 19:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
