(3297204, 456130, 18080, '<td valign="top">I know that there is a lot of PP in this shot, but i still think it is one of the best shots that has ever appeared on this site.<br/>10<br/>I love it.<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'I know that there is a lot of PP in this shot, but i still think it is one of the best shots that has ever appeared on this site.10I love it. Kev', '2007-01-29 05:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
