(3298228, 458820, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s a reproduction - albeit well photographed - of someone else''s art and creative ability.  You, as photographer are merely acting as distributor.  Although well photographed, the aspects of this photo which attract are entirely reliant on the artist''s work.  Therefore, in that it is a challenge related to photography, my vote is as follows: Artist: 10 Photographer: 1</td>', 'It''s a reproduction - albeit well photographed - of someone else''s art and creative ability.  You, as photographer are merely acting as distributor.  Although well photographed, the aspects of this photo which attract are entirely reliant on the artist''s work.  Therefore, in that it is a challenge related to photography, my vote is as follows: Artist: 10 Photographer: 1', '2007-01-29 11:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
