(3303405, 458734, 66348, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful shot, love the colors and contrast in this picture. Very well set up and done. Nice work.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful shot, love the colors and contrast in this picture. Very well set up and done. Nice work.', '2007-01-30 14:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303408, 458663, 66348, '<td valign="top">Oh thats just a sweet car. Love the shot and idea. Well done.</td>', 'Oh thats just a sweet car. Love the shot and idea. Well done.', '2007-01-30 14:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303418, 458328, 66348, '<td valign="top">This picture strikes me as amazing, I love the idea, the different makeup and the sharpness. It fills the frame. Only thing would have been better IMO is to clone out the photographer in her eyes. Other than that its a great shot, with excellant setup. I really hope this ribbons, its by far THE BEST of the challenge. 10.</td>', 'This picture strikes me as amazing, I love the idea, the different makeup and the sharpness. It fills the frame. Only thing would have been better IMO is to clone out the photographer in her eyes. Other than that its a great shot, with excellant setup. I really hope this ribbons, its by far THE BEST of the challenge. 10.', '2007-01-30 14:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303422, 456510, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower, love the colors, well done.</td>', 'Beautiful flower, love the colors, well done.', '2007-01-30 14:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303431, 457255, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool idea and shot, the lighting is great, the PP is well done. Very nicely setup and done.</td>', 'This is a really cool idea and shot, the lighting is great, the PP is well done. Very nicely setup and done.', '2007-01-30 14:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303439, 457186, 66348, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the makeup is sweet. Very well setup and done. Def a top 5 shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Love the colors and the makeup is sweet. Very well setup and done. Def a top 5 shot. Nice work.', '2007-01-30 14:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303441, 458811, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the antique and grunge feel to it. Very nice idea and subject. Well done.</td>', 'Great shot, I love the antique and grunge feel to it. Very nice idea and subject. Well done.', '2007-01-30 14:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303445, 458188, 66348, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine the work that went into this, so I wanted to acknowledge that it is a great shot, however usually this much PP doesn''t do very well. But I think it is a great idea and shot, and wish you the best of luck in the challenge. 8.</td>', 'I can''t imagine the work that went into this, so I wanted to acknowledge that it is a great shot, however usually this much PP doesn''t do very well. But I think it is a great idea and shot, and wish you the best of luck in the challenge. 8.', '2007-01-30 14:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303452, 458331, 66348, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up and shot, really like the color. I think you could have knocked down the brightness a bit and shot up the contrast and saturation and it would have been a even bigger knock out, IMO. Nice work.</td>', 'Nicely set up and shot, really like the color. I think you could have knocked down the brightness a bit and shot up the contrast and saturation and it would have been a even bigger knock out, IMO. Nice work.', '2007-01-30 14:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303459, 458542, 66348, '<td valign="top">It looks like you have a great eye for photography. Ok that was a stupid joke, but I really like your shot here, the editing is sweet and it looks like a great poster for a movie. Love the grunge effect also. Well done.</td>', 'It looks like you have a great eye for photography. Ok that was a stupid joke, but I really like your shot here, the editing is sweet and it looks like a great poster for a movie. Love the grunge effect also. Well done.', '2007-01-30 14:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303463, 458838, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful colors and shot here. The pink with the white''s and yellow really go great. Nice work.</td>', 'Very beautiful colors and shot here. The pink with the white''s and yellow really go great. Nice work.', '2007-01-30 14:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303467, 455724, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great shot, editing and idea. Well done.</td>', 'Great shot, editing and idea. Well done.', '2007-01-30 14:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303470, 456720, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great title and shot. It goes perfect. Very well filled. And sharpness and clarity are right on. Well done.</td>', 'Great title and shot. It goes perfect. Very well filled. And sharpness and clarity are right on. Well done.', '2007-01-30 14:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303474, 457313, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is just a sweet shot, love the colors and lightness. Eyes are incredible, sharpness is right on. Was there any way to remove that glare in her eye? Other than that, a for sure top 5 IMO. Great shot. 9</td>', 'This is just a sweet shot, love the colors and lightness. Eyes are incredible, sharpness is right on. Was there any way to remove that glare in her eye? Other than that, a for sure top 5 IMO. Great shot. 9', '2007-01-30 14:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303479, 458639, 66348, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, love the B/W with color. Excellant setup and shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Sweet shot, love the B/W with color. Excellant setup and shot. Nice work.', '2007-01-30 14:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
