(3313560, 458608, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great way to shoot a cat!  I love the way this is composed.  I''d borrow the idea but it won''t work nearly as well with a non-striped cat.</td>', 'Great way to shoot a cat!  I love the way this is composed.  I''d borrow the idea but it won''t work nearly as well with a non-striped cat.', '2007-02-01 14:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313564, 458685, 63163, '<td valign="top">I would like this better is it was sharper, more detail.</td>', 'I would like this better is it was sharper, more detail.', '2007-02-01 14:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313565, 458687, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite an intriguing composition - works well, I think.</td>', 'Quite an intriguing composition - works well, I think.', '2007-02-01 14:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313570, 455566, 63163, '<td valign="top">My husband would agree......</td>', 'My husband would agree......', '2007-02-01 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313572, 458639, 30982, '<td valign="top">I still wanna know how you do eyes like that.  Look forward to seeing the steps for this (is it a composite?).  Very nicely done, my dear.</td>', 'I still wanna know how you do eyes like that.  Look forward to seeing the steps for this (is it a composite?).  Very nicely done, my dear.', '2007-02-01 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313592, 456095, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and tones of this, and the composition works well, too.</td>', 'I like the textures and tones of this, and the composition works well, too.', '2007-02-01 14:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314367, 456898, 45475, '<td valign="top">What a great find. Love it! :)</td>', 'What a great find. Love it! :)', '2007-02-01 16:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314389, 458542, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great great work. Love the darkness, the editing is superb. What a brilliant concept :)</td>', 'Great great work. Love the darkness, the editing is superb. What a brilliant concept :)', '2007-02-01 16:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314510, 458444, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like all the colors.</td>', 'I like all the colors.', '2007-02-01 17:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314525, 458639, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice processing. That apple is wicked looking. I don''t know what that bright spot is in the lower right corner, but it is rather distracting.</td>', 'Nice processing. That apple is wicked looking. I don''t know what that bright spot is in the lower right corner, but it is rather distracting.', '2007-02-01 17:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314550, 458346, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of the Expert Editing rules to fill the frame with a single subject. The composition is very disjointed though, and doesn''t allow the eye to flow smoothly around the image.</td>', 'Very creative use of the Expert Editing rules to fill the frame with a single subject. The composition is very disjointed though, and doesn''t allow the eye to flow smoothly around the image.', '2007-02-01 17:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314568, 458514, 66384, '<td valign="top">That''s so cute. I love the little pink tongue. I think it would be more effective if the left side was cropped more, and just the cat''s face filled the frame.</td>', 'That''s so cute. I love the little pink tongue. I think it would be more effective if the left side was cropped more, and just the cat''s face filled the frame.', '2007-02-01 17:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314574, 456291, 19952, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! Great concept and flawless execution that shows what a truly creative mind can do with the Expert rule set.</td>', 'Brilliant! Great concept and flawless execution that shows what a truly creative mind can do with the Expert rule set.', '2007-02-01 17:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314589, 458739, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why this was cropped so tight on the top and bottom. I''d rather see a little more of the circles.</td>', 'I''m not sure why this was cropped so tight on the top and bottom. I''d rather see a little more of the circles.', '2007-02-01 17:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314592, 458589, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very pretty lines, colors, and lighting. I like the little touch of pink at the top.</td>', 'Very pretty lines, colors, and lighting. I like the little touch of pink at the top.', '2007-02-01 17:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314593, 455248, 19952, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary crispness and color. I''m sure others are telling you that the reflections would actually be upside-down if these were water droplets, but I don''t mind that at all since this is a digital creation, and a really beautiful one at that. Great job!</td>', 'Extraordinary crispness and color. I''m sure others are telling you that the reflections would actually be upside-down if these were water droplets, but I don''t mind that at all since this is a digital creation, and a really beautiful one at that. Great job!', '2007-02-01 17:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314614, 456256, 66384, '<td valign="top">Cool macro. Is that a bug on the bug''s chin? For the purposes of this challenge, I think you could have cropped the top down to the top of the grasshopper''s (?) head.</td>', 'Cool macro. Is that a bug on the bug''s chin? For the purposes of this challenge, I think you could have cropped the top down to the top of the grasshopper''s (?) head.', '2007-02-01 17:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314624, 457313, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful high key image with outstanding composition and processing. Even knowing that it''s a duplicate of the same eye, this photo is still just extraordinary, perhaps even more so.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful high key image with outstanding composition and processing. Even knowing that it''s a duplicate of the same eye, this photo is still just extraordinary, perhaps even more so.', '2007-02-01 17:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314643, 457124, 66384, '<td valign="top">Just curious to know why you didn''t crop all the way in to truly fill the frame with the hamster. As cute as this is, I think it would have been even better without the background - especially the cage.</td>', 'Just curious to know why you didn''t crop all the way in to truly fill the frame with the hamster. As cute as this is, I think it would have been even better without the background - especially the cage.', '2007-02-01 18:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314659, 458829, 66384, '<td valign="top">It''s a terrific image even without the mouse in the eyes, but that is a little extra fun. Good use of expert editing.</td>', 'It''s a terrific image even without the mouse in the eyes, but that is a little extra fun. Good use of expert editing.', '2007-02-01 18:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314685, 458305, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely bright colors and nice detail in the white. I''d like to see it with a little more of the right side cropped.</td>', 'Lovely bright colors and nice detail in the white. I''d like to see it with a little more of the right side cropped.', '2007-02-01 18:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314693, 455816, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very lovely landscape, but doesn''t meet the challenge, IMO.</td>', 'Very lovely landscape, but doesn''t meet the challenge, IMO.', '2007-02-01 18:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314708, 458750, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the processing.</td>', 'I like the processing.', '2007-02-01 18:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314737, 458513, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of a distant shot to meet a Fill the Frame challenge. The patterns are excellent, good light, good composition, and I like the colors a lot. 10</td>', 'Very nice use of a distant shot to meet a Fill the Frame challenge. The patterns are excellent, good light, good composition, and I like the colors a lot. 10', '2007-02-01 18:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314744, 457108, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the black, white, and red.</td>', 'I love the black, white, and red.', '2007-02-01 18:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314792, 456419, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this better with the bottom cropped up to the chin or even to the mouth.</td>', 'I think I would like this better with the bottom cropped up to the chin or even to the mouth.', '2007-02-01 18:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314807, 458758, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, diagonal line, and good use of "fill the frame".</td>', 'Nice focus, diagonal line, and good use of "fill the frame".', '2007-02-01 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314884, 457254, 66384, '<td valign="top">Are you addicted or just over-worked? Funny idea, well done.</td>', 'Are you addicted or just over-worked? Funny idea, well done.', '2007-02-01 18:49:51.000000', NULL, 1);
