(3317825, 458228, 66597, '<td valign="top">I was one of your higher votes in this challenge (7), and would have given the original an 8 or 9. In fact, I think the original is a real piece of artwork. I love it. The composition is outstanding.</td>', 'I was one of your higher votes in this challenge (7), and would have given the original an 8 or 9. In fact, I think the original is a real piece of artwork. I love it. The composition is outstanding.', '2007-02-02 08:19:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317830, 458657, 66597, '<td valign="top">Don - I was one of your higher votes in this challenge. I like the spooky feel tremendously. The best part is that it is impossible to judge the relative size of the silo, which adds to the drama. Well done!</td>', 'Don - I was one of your higher votes in this challenge. I like the spooky feel tremendously. The best part is that it is impossible to judge the relative size of the silo, which adds to the drama. Well done!', '2007-02-02 08:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317840, 456510, 66597, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your great placing! Really nice composition and excellent job with those tricky whites. My only suggestion would be to apply slight noise reduction.</td>', 'Congrats on your great placing! Really nice composition and excellent job with those tricky whites. My only suggestion would be to apply slight noise reduction.', '2007-02-02 08:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317846, 458102, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bob,<br/>I felt when voting that there was somthing slightly askew on the perspective and that it may be just a tad underexposed. However, I love the blue line of windows - adds a lot of drama. It''s an interesting shot with a lot of potential.</td>', 'Bob,I felt when voting that there was somthing slightly askew on the perspective and that it may be just a tad underexposed. However, I love the blue line of windows - adds a lot of drama. It''s an interesting shot with a lot of potential.', '2007-02-02 08:27:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317856, 458830, 66597, '<td valign="top">Christian - I like how some of the fingers look like fingers, and others like skeleton hands. This is a very interesting idea, with cool colors. The composition could be a bit stronger - I read from your comments that you threw it together at the last minute (pretty impressive for a one hour effort). Hope you''ll do it again and post in your portfolio.</td>', 'Christian - I like how some of the fingers look like fingers, and others like skeleton hands. This is a very interesting idea, with cool colors. The composition could be a bit stronger - I read from your comments that you threw it together at the last minute (pretty impressive for a one hour effort). Hope you''ll do it again and post in your portfolio.', '2007-02-02 08:30:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317862, 456291, 58728, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon!  This is an excellent shot.  Extremely creative and fun.  ;)  ~Magen</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon!  This is an excellent shot.  Extremely creative and fun.  ;)  ~Magen', '2007-02-02 08:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317907, 458025, 66597, '<td valign="top">Well Deb, I was one of your higher scores, and think this is underrated. Of course, I love cats, and I know some people are biased against them. I actually think this would sell well - it is the type of thing I would buy, at least. Great photo!</td>', 'Well Deb, I was one of your higher scores, and think this is underrated. Of course, I love cats, and I know some people are biased against them. I actually think this would sell well - it is the type of thing I would buy, at least. Great photo!', '2007-02-02 08:51:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317913, 458025, 15711, '<td valign="top">This certainly suits the the challenge and is a heck of alot more interesting than many of the top contenders.  I''m just not getting the voters these days.</td>', 'This certainly suits the the challenge and is a heck of alot more interesting than many of the top contenders.  I''m just not getting the voters these days.', '2007-02-02 08:53:03.000000', NULL, 0),
