(3318975, 457537, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sheesh, I cannot believe this finished` so low in score. I was one of your seven 10''s...<br/> <br/>In your comments you say: "I actually didn''t do any layers or vignetting like Bear_Music said...Truth is I still don''t know how to do layers yet *ducks and runs!* "<br/> <br/>Let me respond to that with: 1. I never said in my comment anything about layers, and 2. Vignetting = darkening the corners, so yeah you vignetted :-)<br/> <br/>Nice work!</td>', 'Sheesh, I cannot believe this finished` so low in score. I was one of your seven 10''s... In your comments you say: "I actually didn''t do any layers or vignetting like Bear_Music said...Truth is I still don''t know how to do layers yet *ducks and runs!* " Let me respond to that with: 1. I never said in my comment anything about layers, and 2. Vignetting = darkening the corners, so yeah you vignetted :-) Nice work!', '2007-02-02 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
