(3319638, 456016, 70369, '<td valign="top">Yes, his eyes are unedited, except for a few flash spots I cloned out on underneath his eye.. I agree, the lighting just isn''t right for this and what''s really weird is that the photo looked good on my laptop and that''s where I was when I submitted it, but looking at it on our desk top, it was much different.. The flash I used was my SB-600 &amp; it was way too much for this. Lesson learned.. Thanks for looking though. I appreciate any comments or suggestions.</td>', 'Yes, his eyes are unedited, except for a few flash spots I cloned out on underneath his eye.. I agree, the lighting just isn''t right for this and what''s really weird is that the photo looked good on my laptop and that''s where I was when I submitted it, but looking at it on our desk top, it was much different.. The flash I used was my SB-600 & it was way too much for this. Lesson learned.. Thanks for looking though. I appreciate any comments or suggestions.', '2007-02-02 16:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
