(3324539, 458228, 62318, '<td valign="top">Challenge requirements aside: I agree, I love the original much better. The crop you have for the challenge takes away from the fun lines and scene. Since most people would have just put in a DNMC vote anyways, I would have just left the orignal.<br/> <br/>I like the post you did on the orginal, it gives it a sort a strange quirk that would be missing otherwise. Not sure how you did it but it is great. It really brings out textures and lines  that would have otherwised been lost. It is a fun picture, but obviously an entry that would fail to garner high votes due to the radical change and the DNMC. Keep it up though, wonderful  stuff.</td>', 'Challenge requirements aside: I agree, I love the original much better. The crop you have for the challenge takes away from the fun lines and scene. Since most people would have just put in a DNMC vote anyways, I would have just left the orignal. I like the post you did on the orginal, it gives it a sort a strange quirk that would be missing otherwise. Not sure how you did it but it is great. It really brings out textures and lines  that would have otherwised been lost. It is a fun picture, but obviously an entry that would fail to garner high votes due to the radical change and the DNMC. Keep it up though, wonderful  stuff.', '2007-02-03 22:43:55.000000', NULL, 0),
