(3327880, 455566, 46336, '<td valign="top">Hi Hannah, <br/>I love the soft, diffused feel here. Would love to know exactly what editing you did. As posthumous said - it is ''emotive'', although I prefer his statement that it is iconic. <br/>I think your score has been hit by two forms of voting-trolls: the DNMC crowd who would have penalised you for the section on the left, and the expert-editing crowd who want to see the top editign show-cased in this challenge.<br/>Paul</td>', 'Hi Hannah, I love the soft, diffused feel here. Would love to know exactly what editing you did. As posthumous said - it is ''emotive'', although I prefer his statement that it is iconic. I think your score has been hit by two forms of voting-trolls: the DNMC crowd who would have penalised you for the section on the left, and the expert-editing crowd who want to see the top editign show-cased in this challenge.Paul', '2007-02-04 22:42:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3328586, 457313, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if anyone''s commented on the beautiful subtlety of the plain white border, the way it moves in and out of your awareness. I don''t know if you intended it that way or it just worked out like that, but it was a good call. Congrats on your blue!</td>', 'I''m not sure if anyone''s commented on the beautiful subtlety of the plain white border, the way it moves in and out of your awareness. I don''t know if you intended it that way or it just worked out like that, but it was a good call. Congrats on your blue!', '2007-02-05 01:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
