(3330461, 458773, 70828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TIHadi:</b></div><hr/><i> DNMC </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The challenge was to fill the frame with the subject ... the little girl IS the subject and more than fills the frame ... I do not see any background ...  I have NO idea why you would DNMC this photo. <br/> <br/>I agree with the others though ... with the hand cropped out it would have been super. Not because only a face without a hand or anything like that should be in a fill the frame challenge ... but because it is forshortened and bright. <br/> <br/>I also agree that the brightness overall could have been pulled back a bit ... but the EYES are out of this world! ... fashion magazine quality! ... well basically everything in this image is super and honest from the chin line up. That is my opinion.<br/> <br/>Edit: Sorry ... wanted to add ... except the brightness (as I mentioned above could have been pulled back a bit)<br/> <br/>I hope this helps ... keep at it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-05 12:01:04.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by TIHadi: DNMC   The challenge was to fill the frame with the subject ... the little girl IS the subject and more than fills the frame ... I do not see any background ...  I have NO idea why you would DNMC this photo.  I agree with the others though ... with the hand cropped out it would have been super. Not because only a face without a hand or anything like that should be in a fill the frame challenge ... but because it is forshortened and bright.  I also agree that the brightness overall could have been pulled back a bit ... but the EYES are out of this world! ... fashion magazine quality! ... well basically everything in this image is super and honest from the chin line up. That is my opinion. Edit: Sorry ... wanted to add ... except the brightness (as I mentioned above could have been pulled back a bit) I hope this helps ... keep at it.', '2007-02-05 11:59:05.000000', '2007-02-05 12:01:04.000000', 0),
